<title>LUXEMBOURG: Quinn sees no change to EU stability pact.</title>
<headline>Quinn sees no change to EU stability pact.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish Finance Minister Ruairi Quinn said on Sunday he did not expect the European Union's budget stability pact to be changed during finance ministers' talks on Sunday and Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;As regards the terms of the stability pact, I don't expect they will be changed,&quot; he told reporters as he arrived for the talks.</p>
<p>He said that France's new Socialist-led government was concerned about economic governance under European monetary union and these concerns were likely to be raised at the talks.</p>
</text>
